    "title": "Solomon names Sarah Levine, a former deputy AG, as Jersey City corp. counsel - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By John Heinis ,\n7 hours ago Jersey City Mayor James Solomon has named Sarah Levine, a former New Jersey deputy attorney general, as the city’s corporation counsel as of Monday. “Sarah’s combination of legal excellence, public service, and deep roots in Jersey City makes her the ideal person to lead our Law Department,” Solomon said in a statement. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
